354 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 229 0 R
/T (GOOSE is the project's only coreoff-road datasetwith labelled points. Its validation split holds 961 LiDAR frames across eight scenarios, with 174,891,807 points labelled into 64 classes by human annotators. It cannot test long range: across the split, 3.84% of points lie beyond 100 m and 1.10% beyond 150 m. It also has no labelled radar; its Smartmicro radars are not documented as 4D. GOOSE therefore answers the off-road question: can a model tell drivable ground from obstacles? )
/E (GOOSE is the project's only coreoff-road datasetwith labelled points. Its validation split holds 961 LiDAR frames across eight scenarios, with 174,891,807 points labelled into 64 classes by human annotators. It cannot test long range: across the split, 3.84% of points lie beyond 100 m and 1.10% beyond 150 m. It also has no labelled radar; its Smartmicro radars are not documented as 4D. GOOSE therefore answers the off-road question: can a model tell drivable ground from obstacles? )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
