<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 230 0 R
/T (The published PTv3 segmentation model could not run on Apple Silicon \(no CUDA path\). On the team's one CUDA device, a GTX 1660 with 6 GiB, it runs only in FP32 with an attention patch of 64 instead of the published 1,024. The full validation run was stopped after 10 of 961 frames at 18.94 s per frame. Our numbers are therefore diagnostics of a reduced configuration, never a reproduction of the published 0.8096 mIoU. )
/E (The published PTv3 segmentation model could not run on Apple Silicon \(no CUDA path\). On the team's one CUDA device, a GTX 1660 with 6 GiB, it runs only in FP32 with an attention patch of 64 instead of the published 1,024. The full validation run was stopped after 10 of 961 frames at 18.94 s per frame. Our numbers are therefore diagnostics of a reduced configuration, never a reproduction of the published 0.8096 mIoU. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [18]
