<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 239 0 R
/T (Trucks are a recognition problem, not a visibility problem: the merged cloud has points on all 392 scored trucks and 407 of 408 trailers, yet truck AP is 0.009 and trailer AP 0.110. That points to the nuScenes checkpoint not recognising TruckScenes' heavy trucks and trailers. Traffic signs and animals have no nuScenes class and can never score. Camera and LiDAR results come from different architectures and training, so the gap between 0.0046 and 0.1005 is not a sensor comparison. Both are below 150 m and say nothing about D-04.  )
/E (Trucks are a recognition problem, not a visibility problem: the merged cloud has points on all 392 scored trucks and 407 of 408 trailers, yet truck AP is 0.009 and trailer AP 0.110. That points to the nuScenes checkpoint not recognising TruckScenes' heavy trucks and trailers. Traffic signs and animals have no nuScenes class and can never score. Camera and LiDAR results come from different architectures and training, so the gap between 0.0046 and 0.1005 is not a sensor comparison. Both are below 150 m and say nothing about D-04.  )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [21]
>>
