/T (TruckDrive is the only dataset in our project where vehicles are labelled out to a distance of 400 m. The truck includes seven long-range FMCW LiDARs, as well as ten 4D FMCW radars. Our local mini set includes all 24 scenes for radar, label, calibration and poses \(12,502 radar frames, 4,800 box annotation frames and 526,148 3D boxes in 27 classes\). Camera and LiDAR were only included for two representative scenes \(scene_28_1 and scene_28_22\) due to storage constraints, and so no claims cover camera or LiDAR for all 24 scenes. )
/E (TruckDrive is the only dataset in our project where vehicles are labelled out to a distance of 400 m. The truck includes seven long-range FMCW LiDARs, as well as ten 4D FMCW radars. Our local mini set includes all 24 scenes for radar, label, calibration and poses \(12,502 radar frames, 4,800 box annotation frames and 526,148 3D boxes in 27 classes\). Camera and LiDAR were only included for two representative scenes \(scene_28_1 and scene_28_22\) due to storage constraints, and so no claims cover camera or LiDAR for all 24 scenes. )
