1572 0 obj
<<
/Title (5. Any future improvements to the model must include tests which are capable of revealing regressions and reflect the way the model is intended to be used. With more model context, six out of the seven held-out terrain frames were improved, one was made worse, and processing time increased by about 28%. A combined soil score of 99.53% masked a rainy-recording result of 7.92%. Water has not yet been tested \(as stated in Sections 3.3 and 3.5\).)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1085 0 R
/Prev 1927 0 R
>>
