/Title (The aim of the project is to carry out an evidence-based comparison of the ways in which RADAR, LiDAR and camera systems perceive their environment in the context of autonomous trucking, by using existing open-source models on public datasets which have been recorded in a reproducible manner and then provided as a fully documented body of work. The main research question \(D-04\) is whether the current models fail beyond a distance of about 150 metres and whether 4D radar degrades less than LiDAR at that range. Each of the datasets was used as a tool for addressing a different aspect of that question.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1930 0 R
/First 2321 0 R
/Last 2321 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
