/Title (On 29 September 2026 Fariya followed Ricky's GOOSE Windows setup \(EXP-0001\) on a second machine, as a member outside the GOOSE pair. The fresh download held 961 LiDAR scans and 961 label files, and frame 0 rendered with the same 169,883 points and class breakdown as the original run \(bush 35.87%, low grass 20.61%\). The pinned packages worked on Python 3.12 as well as the original 3.11.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
