/Title (GOOSE is the project's only coreoff-road datasetwith labelled points. Its validation split holds 961 LiDAR frames across eight scenarios, with 174,891,807 points labelled into 64 classes by human annotators. It cannot test long range: across the split, 3.84% of points lie beyond 100 m and 1.10% beyond 150 m. It also has no labelled radar; its Smartmicro radars are not documented as 4D. GOOSE therefore answers the off-road question: can a model tell drivable ground from obstacles?)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2479 0 R
/Next 2515 0 R
>>
