2717 0 obj
<<
/Title (Part of the reason is our reduced configuration. On three fixed frames, increasing the attention patch from 64 to 128 to 256 decreased nearby rock-called-ground from 49.52% to 25.02% to 22.56%, and building-called-ground from 18.43% to 10.18% to 4.12%. A repeat of the baseline produced identical predictions, so this is not noise. It is not a complete solution, however, as many rocks are simply relabeled to a different incorrect category.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2707 0 R
/First 2727 0 R
/Last 2727 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 2728 0 R
